    "https://www.southeastern.edu/college-of-business/": {
      "title": "Admissions and Aid",
      "description": "College of Business - Southeastern Louisiana University Skip to main content Apply Give Visit Admissions and Aid Learn about Admissions and Aid Financial Aid Scholarships Tuition and Fees Academics Learn about Academics Majors and Minors University Catalog Library Academic Calendar Graduate Studies Southeastern Online College of Arts, Humanities and Social Sciences College of Business College of Education, Health and Human Sciences College of Nursing College of Science and Technology College of Honors and Excellence Campus Life Learn about Campus Life Dining Services Housing Safe Campus Rec Center Health Center Campus Map (opens in a new tab) Parking Division of Student Affairs About Learn about Southeastern History Administration Accreditation Offices and Services Employee Directory News Read all of our news sources News Southeastern Magazine Profiles Blog Lion Up Radio (opens in a new tab) Southeastern Channel (opens in a new tab) Lion’s Roar (opens in a new tab) Athletics (opens in a new tab) Quick Links Canvas (opens in a new tab) Workday (opens in a new tab) Okta Login Portal (opens in a new tab) Gmail (opens in a new tab) Calendar (opens in a new tab) Learn about Workday Links For Alumni Home College of Business Explore this section Explore this section Scholarships Corporate and Community Programs Professional Advancement Programs Student Research Student Organizations Internship and Job Opportunities Staff College of Business FAQs The Lion Pride Career Closet Gain a cutting edge in your future business career through unparalleled educational experiences in Southeastern’s College of Business. Learn from faculty who are experts in their disciplines and recognized nationally and internationally for their work. You’ll graduate with the skills that are highly in demand by growing state industries, setting you on a path to success. The mission of the College of Business at Southeastern Louisiana University is to engage and grow a community of learners through quality educational experiences while positively impacting the region we serve. College Highlights AACSB-accredited business and accounting programs Numerous Latin American programs and initiatives Annual business lecture series Play embedded video: Learn about the College Watch accessible video for Learn about the College (opens in a new tab) Read video transcript for Learn about the College (opens in a new tab) Departments Department of Accounting and Finance Department of Management and Business Administration Department of Marketing and Supply Chain Management MBA Programs Find Your Path Choose from our quality degree programs in management, marketing, supply chain management, accounting, finance, and more. View Majors and Minors In the News Blog David Wyld – President’s Award for Excellence in Research Long before social media transformed communication and before the internet became woven into daily life, David Wyld was studying its possibilities. By: Tonya Lowentritt August 14, 2026 News Southeastern students honored at Business Convocation By: Tonya Lowentritt May 13, 2026 News Southeastern enriches career exploration opportunities in Tangipahoa and Washington parishes By: Tonya Lowentritt May 7, 2026 News Southeastern to present Research and Innovation Showcase By: Tonya Lowentritt March 17, 2026 View all News Upcoming Events View all Events (opens in a new tab) Profiles Student Profile Get There: Into Procuring Success With an extended internship in procurement already under her belt, supply chain management major Kelis Wilson is already well on her way to her dream job of traveling the world as a senior purchasing and procurement manager. July 5, 2026 View all Profiles Contact Us Location Campus Address Garrett Hall, Room 84 SLU Box 10735 Hammond, LA 70402 Phone (985) 549-2258 Email business​@southeastern.edu Dean Professor / Dean Tará Lopez, D.B.A. Connect College of Businesss's Facebook account (opens in a new tab) College of Businesss'